# AXI25 — line-ending normalization so the vault behaves the same on any OS.
# (No Git LFS: the shipped assets are small PNGs stored as normal blobs. If you later
#  keep large media in 10-sources/assets and want LFS, add filters here + `lfs: true`
#  to the CI checkout steps.)
*.md   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
